(FMT-45, FMT-46 — `{{` renders one literal `{` and `}}` renders one
 literal `}`. Probed apart from each other as well as together, so a
 doubled-brace pair being swallowed as one unit would still show.
 Ran: VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox probe.vox -o p && ./p
 expected output:
   open {
   close }
   Use {braces} for literal braces.
)
Print "open {{".
Print "close }}".
Print "Use {{braces}} for literal braces.".
